  "body": "This PR adds a new ai-ml/physical-ai-on-gke sample demonstrating an end-to-end Physical AI / Vision-Language-Action (VLA) workflow on GKE using Ray on Kubernetes (KubeRay).\r\n\r\nThe sample fine-tunes the PI0.5 3.4B-parameter VLA policy on the LIBERO robotics dataset across 8 GPUs, serves it behind Ray Serve, evaluates it with 8 parallel simulation workers, and feeds filtered trajectories back into a retraining round — a complete closed-loop data flywheel.\r\n\r\nco-contributor: @rick-c-goog ",
